Here is the complete single-file implementation:

Multi-Role Portal & Admin System



Key Highlights of the Architecture
Authentication & Multi-Portal Tabs (Top Navigation):

Section 1: First Registration / Access: Provides full onboarding fields (Full Name, Mobile Phone, Email, Password, Confirm Password) and role selection (Seller vs Buyer), immediately routing the registrant with active session access.

Section 2: User Login: Allows sellers and buyers to log in seamlessly using their Mobile Number OR Email and password.

Section 3: Admin Portal: Dedicated high-security admin login for both Normal Admins and the Primary Super Admin.

Common Accessible Sections for Seller & Buyer:

Help & Guidance: Contains structured sub-tabs covering the Basic Guide, Platform Rules & Regulations, Seller & Buyer Guidelines, and the Normal Order Procedure.

Admins Contact: A live contact directory displaying phone numbers and email addresses of active administrators alongside a direct support ticket submission form.

Account Security / Password: Allows logged-in sellers and buyers to change and confirm their personal passwords at any time.

Admin Hierarchy & Access Control:

Normal Admin: Handles order verification workflows, processes status transitions (Pending Verification → Verified & Dispatched → Completed), and resolves customer issues. Strict access control prevents normal admins from managing staff.

Primary Admin (Super Admin): Enjoys all normal operational features plus an exclusive Primary Console with capabilities to Add new admins, Block/Unblock admins, and Reset/override user passwords by mobile number.

Strict Segregation: Buyers and Sellers are completely restricted from viewing or accessing administrative features.
